        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyuuth go̱kä kɛ bo̱o̱th palä in di̱i̱t",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial ɣä lɛ nyuɔ̱th bo̱o̱th palä in di̱i̱t ni Jɔ-cua tëë cuŋä nhiam jääkä Kuɔth Nhial. Kä te Cɛy-tan cuŋä kui̱c cuëëc Jɔ-cua gɔɔnyɛ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial Cɛy-tan jiök i̱, “Ci Kuoth Nhial ji̱ kuɛth Cɛy-tan! Ci Kuoth Nhial in ci Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm mɛk ji̱ kuɛth. Ɛn Jɔ-cua ɛ mi ce̱tdɛ kɛ tɛ̈ɛ̈ mi kuanykɛ rɛy maac.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ Jɔ-cua tëë cuŋä nhiam jääkä Kuɔth kɛ bi̱i̱ mi lɔw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu jääk Kuɔth nɛy tin te cuŋä nhiamdɛ jiök i̱, “Wuɔcɛ bieyni tɔ̱ lɔathni tɔ̱tɔ̱ puɔ̱ɔ̱nydɛ.” Kä cuɛ Jɔ-cua jiök i̱, “Ɣän cä dueerku woc kä ji̱, kä bä ji̱ moc kɛ bieyni ti gɔw.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua̱ wee i̱, “Akɛ la̱th kɛ kum mi gɔaa wi̱i̱dɛ.” Kä cua jɛ la̱th wi̱i̱dɛ, kä cua jɛ moc kɛ bi̱i̱. Kä te jääk Kuɔth Nhial cuŋä kutdɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu jääk Kuɔth Nhial Jɔ-cua jiök i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nɛmɛ ɛ min ci Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa ɛ lar, ɛn ɣöö mi guuri ni duɔ̱ɔ̱pdä, kä tiitdi ŋuɔ̱tkä, deri luaakdä yop kä deri rɛy kalɛ tit, kä dëë ji̱ moc kɛ gua̱a̱th rɛy nɛɛni ti te cuŋä ti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä liŋɛ täämɛ lö bo̱o̱th palä in di̱i̱t ni Jɔ-cua, yɛnɛ mäthniku tin te nhiamdu. Kɛn kɛ ji̱ nyuuthä ti gɔw. Ɣän bä ja̱ŋdä ni yuan jiaath nööŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛnɛ ɣän la̱thä päm kɛl nhiam Jɔ-cua, ɛn päm ɛ mɔ tëë kɛ pek da̱ŋ bärɔw. Kä ɣän bä gɔ̱r, kä bä duer muɔ̱ɔ̱n ɛ mi woc kɛ jɛn cäŋ ɔ kɛl ɔ, ruac ni ɣän Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa ruac ɛn ɣöö ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ bi ramɔ gua̱n thieekädɛ cɔal thaar jiaathdɛ kɛ mal.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
